OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer charities 'honoured' by
OL,4,AKing's awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers from charities across the
OL,7,FWest say they are "honoured" to be
OL,8,Fgiven a prestigious King's Award for
OL,9,FVoluntary Service - a charity
OL,10,Fequivalent of an MBE.
OL,12,FCASS & Friends in Gloucestershire,
OL,13,Fwhich provides financial aid and
OL,14,Fcoaching to young athletes, has been
OL,15,Fpraised for its outstanding work in
OL,16,Fsupporting the community.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
