OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteer charities 'honoured' by
OL,4,AKing's awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Treehouse, which helps
OL,7,Fbereaved families and children, has
OL,8,Falso been awarded along with the
OL,9,FStrawberry Line Society in Somerset,
OL,10,Fwhich maintains a cycling and walking
OL,11,Fpath along a disused railway line.
OL,12,FVolunteers at the Richard Jefferies
OL,13,FMuseum in Swindon were also honoured.
OL,15,F"We are over the moon," said Sarah Bear
OL,16,Ffrom Wiltshire Treehouse.
